      "content": "It looks like the list got cut off at number 9. Could you finish that and then give me a few more? \n\nActually, to make this dataset really useful for the classifier, I need a bit more variety in the types of bias. The first few you gave are good, but could you provide a few more examples that focus specifically on assumptions about competence, leadership capability, or \"cultural fit\"? I want to see if the model can capture the subtle ways people might be sidelined based on their perceived background without it being an obvious insult.",
